          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the beginning of your shooting phase, select one unit within 12&quot;, that unit must make a leadership test with a -1 modifier to that roll. If that roll is failed that unit takes D3+1 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
